Auto-select first synth track on startup. (Partially done)

On startup, automatically select the first synth track so the synth
editor and piano roll are visible without manual track selection.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] On engine init, first synth track is selected as active track
- [ ] Synth editor panel visible immediately on startup
- [ ] Piano roll visible immediately on startup
- [ ] If no synth tracks exist, no track is selected (no crash)

## Test Plan
- [ ] Launch app, verify synth editor visible without clicking anything
- [ ] Launch with project that has no synth tracks, verify no crash
- [ ] Launch with project where first track is sampler, verify correct synth track found
